    "text": "P.S. No: PS/CSA/00/9/1/1 It is hereby notified that the Hon. President, in terms of Article 154B of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has appointed following persons as Hon. Provincial Governors with effect from May 02, 2024.",
